# NurseAdda

Enterprise Healthcare Workforce Management System

## Description

NurseAdda is a Java Full Stack enterprise application developed to automate healthcare staffing operations.

## Tech Stack

- Java 21
- Spring Boot
- React
- TypeScript
- MySQL
- Spring Security
- JWT
- Docker
- GitHub Actions

## Features

- Authentication
- User Management
- Staff Management
- Client Management
- Assignment Management
- Attendance
- Invoice
- Payment
- Dashboard

## Architecture

React → REST API → Spring Boot → MySQL

